es the game an accessible fantasy vibe with readable classes that add to the game\u2019s replayability. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969100/extras/8ba7047079add05c94cfd6115c33d7cf.avif?t=1731144136\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969100/extras/fb0255eccce56a168d98a82815010286.poster.avif?t=1731144136\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969100/extras/fb0255eccce56a168d98a82815010286.webm?t=1731144136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969100/extras/fb0255eccce56a168d98a82815010286.mp4?t=1731144136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MIGHT\u2019N MOW\u2019EM will offer Early Access and initially comes with:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>6 Classes</i> \u2013 Each with unique characteristics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>12 Weapons &amp; Items</i> \u2013 All made to mow thousands of enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>6 Ultimates</i> \u2013 Special abilities that can change the tides of battle.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>15+ Perks</i> \u2013 Offering long-term progression. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>3 Stages</i> \u2013 With unique enemies and bosses.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>2-4 Multiplayer</i> \u2013 The possibility to play together with your friends online. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Town Hub</i> \u2013 A beautiful 2D side-scrolling metagame environment.</p></li></ul>",
